---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE_NAME, withBase } from "../../consts";
---

<Layout title="Privacy & cookies" description="Privacy and cookie policy.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-4xl">Privacy &amp; cookies</h1>

    <div class="mt-4 rounded-md border border-dashed border-gold-500/50 bg-gold-400/10 px-4 py-3 font-body text-sm text-ink-soft">
      <strong class="text-ink">Draft to be adjusted.</strong> This page translates the
      reference version, the <a href={withBase("/confidentialite/")} class="link-underline text-ink">French privacy policy</a>.
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Data collected</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          {SITE_NAME} doesn't require any registration and doesn't collect any personal data other than what's needed
          for audience measurement and, eventually, for displaying ads.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          A banner lets you accept or decline non-essential cookies on your first visit. Your choice is stored in your
          browser (local storage) and is never sent anywhere else. You can change it at any time by clearing this
          site's data in your browser.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Advertising &amp; affiliate links</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Some links on the site are affiliate links: they may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. Advertising
          spaces are also planned on the site. No third-party advertising script is loaded until consent has been
          given.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Under the GDPR, you have the right to access, correct and delete data about you. For any questions, contact
          [your contact email].
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
